{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Introduction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the ancient Yellowstone continent, a magic with corrupt energy slowly erodes here, and the creatures touched become extremely cruel. However, intelligent creatures increasingly crave the additional power brought by this energy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist seems to be a &quot;destined person&quot; guided by fate, slowly uncovering the truth of the dark magic of this continent under the guidance of angels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, things are not that simple, and the so-called justice on this continent is far from it. Conspiracy has gradually surfaced with the investigation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Gameplay Introduction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a very traditional turn based game, where the vast majority of elements in turn based games are included</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game has a linear storyline without any decryption elements, ensuring that players can enjoy the game all the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a very rich system of props and equipment, including up to 110 dynamic enemies and 80 dynamic bosses with dragon bones, and players can control more than 30 character images</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has undergone testing and feedback from over 300 players, and is now guaranteed to have almost no bugs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At present, the game duration can reach 40 hours. If you like brush type games, then you will definitely love this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614570/extras/GIF__0_.gif?t=1744336638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614570/extras/GIF__2_.gif?t=1744336638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614570/extras/GIF__4_.gif?t=1744336638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614570/extras/GIF__5_.gif?t=1744336638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614570/extras/GIF__3_.gif?t=1744336638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614570/extras/GIF__1_.gif?t=1744336638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Author's words</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game has been in production since 2021, and all the content was independently completed by me. It's finally over, and it's something to be happy about (laughs)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Making games and playing them for everyone has always been my wish, and now it has finally come true. This is also a manifestation of my self-worth, isn't it? (laughs)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I hope everyone can have a happy experience with this game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I also wish you good health and a happy life!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614570?t=1744336638","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614570/a8056393b9780738903329c6afac3d7c15126da7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744336638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614570/e03311d3fbf290ace497bf2d01ede8ee9184f97e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744336638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614570/e03311d3fbf290ace497bf2d01ede8ee9184f97e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17